flowchart LR
  Task[Task text or explicit capabilities] --> Analyze[Deterministic task analysis]
  Analyze --> Required[Required capability names]
  Required --> Index[Catalog capability lookup]
  Index --> Evidence[Declared / observed / inferred evidence]
  Evidence --> Guards{Approved, healthy, fresh?}
  Guards -->|No| Excluded[Explain exclusion]
  Guards -->|Yes| Rank[Rank by evidence support]
  Rank --> Matches["Candidate agents and match reasons"]
  Required -->|Unknown task| Empty["No match; request explicit capability"]
